<div class="hcm-or-cat"><div class="hcm-or-cat-head" onclick="hcmOrToggle(this)"><h3>Comfort and Daily Use Experience Reviews</h3><svg class="hcm-or-cat-toggle" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M19 13h-6v6h-2v-6H5v-2h6V5h2v6h6v2z"/></svg></div><div class="hcm-or-cat-body"><div class="hcm-or-cat-inner"><div class="hcm-or-quote"><p>"I use my Bodyfriend every evening — usually a 20-minute session while I decompress. It has genuinely become the best part of my evening routine."</p><cite>— R.H. · Remote worker · 8 months ownership</cite></div>
