<div class="hcm-or-cat"><div class="hcm-or-cat-head" onclick="hcmOrToggle(this)"><h3>Massage Intensity and Deep Tissue Feel</h3><svg class="hcm-or-cat-toggle" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M19 13h-6v6h-2v-6H5v-2h6V5h2v6h6v2z"/></svg></div><div class="hcm-or-cat-body"><div class="hcm-or-cat-inner"><div class="hcm-or-quote"><p>"The XD-Pro rollers deliver real pressure — not the weak kind you forget about. I can adjust intensity easily, and the deeper settings actually work on my tension spots."</p><cite>— C.W. · Active lifestyle · 7 months ownership</cite></div>
