<div class="hcm-or-quote"><p>"My favorite routine: zero gravity + gentle wellness program + heat. Twenty minutes and I feel completely reset after a long work day."</p><cite>— L.K. · Remote worker · 8 months ownership</cite></div><div class="hcm-or-summary"><p><strong>Summary:</strong> <strong>Zero gravity recline</strong> is consistently one of the highest-rated Bodyfriend features. Many users enjoy it even without an active massage session. <strong>This feature alone is often cited as a primary reason for purchase satisfaction.</strong></p></div></div></div></div>
<div class="hcm-or-cat"><div class="hcm-or-cat-head" onclick="hcmOrToggle(this)"><h3>Heat Therapy Features Reviews</h3><svg class="hcm-or-cat-toggle" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M19 13h-6v6h-2v-6H5v-2h6V5h2v6h6v2z"/></svg></div><div class="hcm-or-cat-body"><div class="hcm-or-cat-inner"><div class="hcm-or-quote"><p>"The heat feature warms up nicely — especially in the lumbar area. It makes the whole massage feel more soothing and spa-like."</p><cite>— P.A. · Daily user · 5 months ownership</cite></div>
<div class="hcm-or-quote"><p>"I love the zoned heat on my Leonardo DV. The warmth across different areas during a session adds a lot to the relaxation experience."</p><cite>— B.N. · Design-conscious buyer · 4 months ownership</cite></div>
<div class="hcm-or-quote"><p>"The heat is pleasant but gentle. If you're expecting deep therapeutic heat like a heating pad, adjust your expectations. It's more of a comfort layer."</p><cite>— G.T. · Realistic reviewer · 3 months ownership</cite></div><div class="hcm-or-summary"><p><strong>Summary:</strong> Heat therapy is <strong>appreciated as a comfort enhancement</strong> rather than a medical-grade heat system. The zoned approach across lumbar, seat, and calves is well-received. <strong>Expectation management is important</strong>: customers who understand the heat as a soothing addition rate it more positively.</p></div></div></div></div>
