<div class="hcm-or-tl"><h4>Week 1: Routine Building</h4><p>Auto programs, zero gravity, lower intensity settings, and favorite recline positions become more regularly used. Wellness-focused routines begin to form. Most users adapt to foot roller feel.</p></div>
<div class="hcm-or-tl"><h4>Month 1: Favorite Features Emerge</h4><p>Users find their preferred programs, ideal massage intensity, and daily wellness routines. The technology features become more intuitive. Zero gravity and wellness programs become daily habits.</p></div>
<div class="hcm-or-tl"><h4>Month 3+: Long-Term Value Perception</h4><p>Daily use, family use, premium relaxation rituals, and at-home wellness habits make the investment value more tangible. Chair performance remains consistent. Satisfaction deepens as the chair becomes part of daily life.</p></div>
